    "en": {
      "trackName": "Plunge: Into the Depths",
      "description": "Plunge is an endless descent game made for Apple Watch. Turn the Digital Crown to rotate the tower and guide a metal ball through the gaps.\n\nKEEP THE FALL GOING\nPass through gaps to score. Clear three in a row to break through platforms or melt through snow. Touching snow too soon will end your run.\n\nA NEW CHALLENGE EACH DAY\nEvery player starts with the same daily tower. Play offline and keep your best scores on your Watch, or sign in with Apple to compete on the daily global leaderboard.\n\nTHREE WAYS TO CHANGE YOUR RUN\nCollect \"Split\" to play with two balls, \"Feather\" to slow the action, or \"Shrink\" to squeeze through tighter openings.\n\nPlunge runs independently on Apple Watch and requires watchOS 10 or later.",
